---
---

<section class="py-14 sm:py-20 bg-white border-b border-zinc-200/80 font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Shopify Clean Minimalist) -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">
        Pilihan Kebutuhan Proyek
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-2">
        Beli Material Konstruksi atau Bangun Terima Jadi?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 font-normal">
        Kami menyediakan opsi belanja material saja atau paket pengerjaan turnkey sesuai rencana Anda.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2 Pathways Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
      
      <!-- Path 1: Butuh Material Konstruksi -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-2xs">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Saya Membutuhkan Material Konstruksi Saja
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Cocok jika Anda sudah memiliki tim perakit sendiri atau ingin merenovasi dan menyulam plastik UV greenhouse lama Anda.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-900 block mb-2">Material Konstruksi Siap Kirim:</span>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 font-medium">Plastik UV 200µm</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 font-medium">Paranet 65-75%</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 font-medium">Insect Net 50 Mesh</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 font-medium">Spring Clip Lock</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 font-medium">Selang Drip 16mm</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 font-medium">Mulsa MPHP</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/produk/perlengkapan-greenhouse/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 text-white font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Katalog Material Greenhouse</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Path 2: Buat Greenhouse Terima Jadi -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/80 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-2xs">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
            Saya Ingin Bangun Greenhouse Terima Jadi
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Tim aplikator kami menangani dari perencanaan desain struktur, survei lahan, simulasi RAB transparan, hingga instalasi selesai siap tanam.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-900 block mb-2">Layanan Kontraktor Meliputi:</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-600">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Analisis kondisi angin, arah matahari &amp; topografi lahan</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Desain struktur ventilasi monitor roof penurun suhu</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Pondasi cor beton &amp; sambungan klem galvanis tanpa las</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Instalasi fertigasi otomatis &amp; serah terima operasional</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/jasa/pembuatan-greenhouse/#kalkulator"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Hitung Estimasi Biaya RAB</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
